{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-14","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third has to a fourth, and the first be greater than the third, the second will also be greater than the fourth; if equal, equal; and if less, less.","book":5,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","contentId":"euclid-5-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"511ff175b92d10eee79b538e95908d58be4ed579d8062818b4bfec6693e4f1fa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-14.statement","euclid-5-14.construction.1","euclid-5-14.proof.1","euclid-5-14.proof.2","euclid-5-14.proof.3","euclid-5-14.proof.4","euclid-5-14.conclusion","euclid-5-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6760bd1cbfc6aabb79fa59f79aa9431c8ce6b41ceecc35d8a742502ca7e0e4d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a first magnitude have to a second the same ratio as a third has to a fourth, and the first be greater than the third, the second will also be greater than the fourth; if equal, equal; and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一等的比重与第三等的比重相同,而第一等的比重大于第三等,则第二等的比重也将大于第四等;如果等同、等同,如果差差等,则则会大于第四等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f914534f883a0a038c96e554cf5f112b5e1a45f63901714d28704edf583f824","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a first magnitude A have the same ratio to a second B as a third C has to a fourth D; and let A be greater than C; I say that B is also greater than D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"初等A与第二等B的比相同,而第三等C与第四等D的比相同;而A则大于C;我说,B也大于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4901e4afd0d6a1b25e6dae26ec2955d4addc2255e638bd09d132289c2e1f5da0","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is greater than C, and B is another, chance, magnitude, therefore A has to B a greater ratio than C has to B. [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A比C还要高,B是另一个机会,规模,因此A必须达到Ba 较大的比比C必须达到B。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8916937d55e92fd4d24a7774fd0d117ece6414710aa20c0d6541b25dbdccf62","citations":["euclid-5-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is C to D; therefore C has also to D a greater ratio than C has to B. [[V. 13](/principles/euclid-5-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A比B等于C比D;因此,C比A比C比B；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[V. 13](/principles/euclid-5-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5cbdcc36d37545f954aae3faa5dcead766d0eb22dcaa2ad4dd7482711807026","citations":["euclid-5-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But that to which the same has a greater ratio is less; [[V. 10](/principles/euclid-5-10)] therefore D is less than B; so that B is greater than D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但同样情况为较大的比的,则少于D的,因此,D的,低于B的,因此,B的,大于D。 [[V. 10](/principles/euclid-5-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a468bcdee757886c1c3e2136e84446cd7ef7cd1fc2abfe10d1c1cfedf99efee7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, if A be equal to C, B will also be equal to D; and, if A be less than C, B will also be less than D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,如果A等于C,B等于D;如果A小于C,B小于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-14.source","contentId":"euclid-5-14","revisionId":"euclid-5-14@raw-511ff175b92d10ee","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb6a49a3105df378451fd35bc4b576495cdf4242bf575e0f114b72a6b2358f71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-14:euclid-5-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-14.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"V. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-14:euclid-5-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-14.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"V. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-14:euclid-5-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-14.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scai